@startuml Roots of Impact - Task Completion Flow
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

actor User
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Task Service" as TaskService
participant "Gamification" as Gamification
participant "Database" as DB
participant "HotelKit" as HotelKit

== User Completes Video Task ==

User -> Frontend: Watch video and answer quiz
Frontend -> Frontend: Validate answers 70 percent correct
Frontend -> API: POST /api/tasks/:id/complete\nwith quiz_answers

API -> API: Authenticate JWT token
API -> TaskService: completeTask(taskId, userId, data)

TaskService -> DB: Check if task already completed
DB --> TaskService: Not completed

TaskService -> DB: Validate quiz answers\n70 percent threshold
DB --> TaskService: Answers valid

TaskService -> DB: Insert user_tasks record
TaskService -> Gamification: addUserPoints(userId, points)
Gamification -> DB: UPDATE users points

TaskService -> Gamification: plantTree(userId, taskId)
Gamification -> DB: INSERT forest trees

alt External Task from HotelKit
    TaskService -> HotelKit: markTaskCompleted(taskId, employeeId)
    HotelKit --> TaskService: Success
end

TaskService -> DB: UPDATE user progress
DB --> TaskService: Success
TaskService --> API: success pointsEarned
API --> Frontend: Response
Frontend -> Frontend: Update UI\nRefresh forest\nShow success message

Frontend -> User: Display\nTask Complete plus 50 points

@enduml
